  "@type": "SemioticProjection",
  "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
  "label": "User projected onto the baker holding bread as a symbol of capitalist efficiency",
  "description": "The user is implicitly projected onto the baker, who is the central visual figure holding bread. The meme frames the baker as the embodiment of the capitalist system's efficiency — where bread (goods) is abundantly produced and readily available, contrasting with the imagined inefficiency of socialism. The user is invited to identify with the baker's role as a provider in a market system, reinforcing the meme's propagandistic message that capitalism is superior because it delivers goods to consumers without requiring queues. The projection is onto the VisualMaterial entity 'baker' and the Scene entity 'baker_holding_bread', which together represent the capitalist ideal.",
